country in the West. And you maybe you can imagine&nbsp;
what that racist analysis is. But it's quite the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:42.640
simple. Haiti is black people, whereas the&nbsp;
Dominican Republic is Latino folks often of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:49.680
with more of of European origin. I mean, that's&nbsp;
the that's the white nationalist sort of crude&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:56.240
racist explanation for the disparity between&nbsp;
Haiti and the Dominican Republic economically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.240 --> 00:03:00.960
and in other ways. Now, this is actually&nbsp;
something that's been studied extensively.&nbsp;&nbsp;

