Jared Diamond in his book Collapse, which I read&nbsp;
just not too long ago, actually talks a lot about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:12.480
it. And when you understand the differences&nbsp;
in Haiti and the Dominican Republic, including&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:16.560
the placement of Haiti in the West and the&nbsp;
Dominican Republic in the east, and what&nbsp;&nbsp;

