there's a very complex situation, in fact, in&nbsp;
the country. And unfortunately, this has led to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:42.320
a situation of significant instability in Haiti,&nbsp;
political problems, environmental degradation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:47.920
and so many other things. And now this on top&nbsp;
of it, just a horrible, horrible situation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

