The New York Times adding the details of who&nbsp;
shot the president and why he remained unknown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:57.600
for people suspected of being involved in the&nbsp;
assassination, were killed by the police in a&nbsp;&nbsp;

